MODULE: ANDROID_PACKAGING

OBJECTIVE:
Package MINERVA as an Android-ready application using Capacitor.

STEPS:
- BuildNextApp
- ConfigurePWA
- AddCapacitor
- AddAndroidPlatform
- ConfigureAppNameMINERVA
- ConfigureIcons
- ConfigureSplashScreen
- BuildAPK

CONFIG:
appId: com.minerva.afoqt
appName: MINERVA
webDir: out
